# Athena Xai v1 — Docker build context exclusions
# Placed in docker-staging/ to exclude non-build files from context transfer.
#
# Note: cuda-libs/ (2.5GB) cannot be excluded — all 4 Dockerfiles COPY it.
# The main savings come from excluding stray files that accumulate in staging.
*.log
*.md
*.txt.bak
.env
.git
.gitignore
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
